o e4, e6, or f4), and my rook will control the crucial 5th rank, preventing the White king from supporting its a3 pawn or interfering with my advancing pawns. This active rook play will lead to a quick win by either capturing the a3 pawn or advancing my own pawns to promotion.\n\nAnswer: R: d6-d5"}
